[en.FOCUS_C01_TECHNOLOGY_DEVELOPMENT]
Science is... Science

[en.FOCUS_C01_TECHNOLOGY_DEVELOPMENT_desc]
The development of industry, science and technology is the primary productive force. The development of science and technology is always companioned with error, and failed experiments are inevitable.\nThe Empire will try its best to encourage talented ponies to engage in civil scientific research, and ensure that they are provided with abundant... experimental materials.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_TECHNOLOGY_DEVELOPMENT]
科学是...科学

[zh.FOCUS_C01_TECHNOLOGY_DEVELOPMENT_desc]
工业的发展，科技是第一生产力。科技的发展总是在错误中不断前进，失败的实验不可避免。\n帝国将会尽力鼓励有才能的小马们从事民用科学研究，并保证向他们的研究提供丰富的...实验材料。

